{"id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-model.md","title":"Model","display":"df-model — Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-model","aliases":["93-df-model"],"display":"df-model — Model","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-model — Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30a8f872911e731f\" href=\"?note=30a8f872911e731f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-theory\">93-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is a first-order-structure candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is the recursively defined Tarski relation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here with the language exposed as an argument.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A model is a first-order structure satisfying every sentence of an explicitly supplied theory. It does not use the propositional formula algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models_{\\mathcal L}$ is the recursively defined Tarski relation of [[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}T","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}","display":false}],"bytes":924,"backlinks":[{"id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f7be4b80a43cd8c3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9e8c89671eb83702","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}$ is the model predicate of [[93-df-model]] and $\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ is the finite-set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]."},{"id":"c000d6833b849019","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61a9386f2a01b571","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}$ (model predicate, see [[93-df-model]])"},{"id":"03527aba4c537723","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e960a212d7978b44","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffe85e118c37beef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7383d8070afb35df","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]"}],"outgoing":["30a8f872911e731f","56c1f813209c75e1"]}